sequenceDiagram
    participant App as Consuming Application<br/>or Notebook
    participant S3 as S3-Compatible Storage<br/>HTTPS / TLS
    participant S3Client as ai4rag S3 Client<br/>(boto3)
    participant Docling as Text Extraction<br/>(docling-slim)
    participant Chunker as Chunking Engine<br/>(AI4RAGChunk)
    participant MaaS as OpenAI-Compatible<br/>MaaS Endpoint<br/>HTTPS / TLS
    participant VectorStore as Vector Store<br/>(Milvus / PGVector / ChromaDB)

    Note over App,VectorStore: Document Ingestion Flow

    App->>S3Client: Ingest documents
    S3Client->>S3: GET objects<br/>Auth: AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID /<br/>AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY
    S3-->>S3Client: Document bytes
    S3Client->>Docling: Raw documents
    Docling->>Chunker: Extracted text
    Note right of Chunker: Generates deterministic<br/>SHA-256 chunk IDs

    Note over App,VectorStore: Embedding Generation Flow

    Chunker->>MaaS: POST embeddings<br/>Auth: API Key<br/>Batch size: up to 1024 chunks
    Note right of MaaS: TLS verification fallback:<br/>retries with verify=False<br/>on SSL cert error
    MaaS-->>Chunker: Embedding vectors

    Note over App,VectorStore: Vector Storage Flow

    alt Milvus Backend
        Chunker->>VectorStore: Store embeddings<br/>gRPC/HTTPS<br/>Auth: MILVUS_TOKEN<br/>Optional: custom PEM cert
    else PGVector Backend
        Chunker->>VectorStore: Store embeddings<br/>PostgreSQL connection<br/>Auth: PGVECTOR_PASSWORD
    else ChromaDB Backend
        Chunker->>VectorStore: Store embeddings<br/>HTTP / ephemeral / persistent
    end

    Note over App,VectorStore: Retrieval Flow

    App->>Chunker: Query text
    Chunker->>MaaS: POST embedding for query<br/>Auth: API Key
    MaaS-->>Chunker: Query embedding
    Chunker->>VectorStore: Similarity search
    VectorStore-->>Chunker: Top-k results
    Chunker-->>App: Retrieved chunks + metadata

    Note over App,VectorStore: Evaluation Flow (Optional)

    App->>Chunker: Run evaluation
    Note right of Chunker: ragas (>=0.3,<0.5)<br/>unitxt (~1.26.1)
    Chunker->>MaaS: LLM evaluation calls<br/>POST chat/completions
    MaaS-->>Chunker: Evaluation results
    Note right of Chunker: pygam optimization<br/>on evaluation metrics
    Chunker-->>App: Optimized RAG configuration
